                                                                                
 Usage: khub reindex [OPTIONS]                                                  
                                                                                
 Regenerate the OKF index.md from the graph: khub reindex [--dry-run].          
                                                                                
╭─ Options ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│ --dry-run          Print the diff against the current index.md and write     │
